          "answer": "probably_no",
          "justification": "Matched placebo pills and identical packs masked participants. Nine assignments were revealed, but the report does not say participants learned them; overall participant awareness is probably absent, with limited possible exceptions. Toxicities alone do not establish recognition of assignment.",
